ized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2480502531","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99269#issuecomment-2480502531","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99269","id":2480502531,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6T2XcD","user":{"login":"xixipig19960424","id":52588533,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNTg4NTMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52588533?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xixipig19960424","html_url":"https://github.com/xixipig19960424","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xixipig19960424/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xixipig19960424/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xixipig19960424/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xixipig19960424/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xixipig19960424/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xixipig19960424/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xixipig19960424/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xixipig19960424/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xixipig19960424/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-16T10:09:34Z","updated_at":"2024-11-16T10:25:18Z","body":"@matheusmdx @mrjustaguy \r\nI just tested with two GPUs, the RTX 4060 and Intel Iris(R) Xe, under the same environment. The memory leak also occurred on the RTX 4060 but not on the Iris(R) Xe. Additionally, the issue appears when using Vulkan but not OpenGL. This leads to a preliminary conclusion that the problem is related to the Vulkan implementation in NVIDIA's GPU driver.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2480502531/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"he