ments/2532745148","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99269#issuecomment-2532745148","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99269","id":2532745148,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6W9p-8","user":{"login":"MatthiasBae","id":52577744,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNTc3NzQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52577744?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae","html_url":"https://github.com/MatthiasBae","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-10T20:00:05Z","updated_at":"2024-12-10T20:00:05Z","body":"I have a similar issue but not the memory is the prblem but the vram. \n\nAs soon as I disable VSync my GPU has a 100% usage. When enabled it is at 5% to max 10%\n\nVSync disabled\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/632a032e-dce2-4a4e-aa4c-8a492de261c8)\n\n\nVSync enabled\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f6d4d2de-4024-4c5a-ab37-36a12b663c83)\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2532745148/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2532773113","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99269#issuecomment-2532773113","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99269","id":2532773113,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6W9wz5","user":{"login":"Lippanon","id":115422160,"node_id":"U_kgDOBuEz0A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115422160?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lippanon","html_url":"https://github.com/Lippanon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lippanon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lippanon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lippanon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lippanon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lippanon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lippanon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lippanon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lippanon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lippanon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-10T20:14:00Z","updated_at":"2024-12-10T20:14:00Z","body":"> As soon as I disable VSync my GPU has a 100% usage. When enabled it is at 5% to max 10%\n\nThat is not a bug (and unrelated to this issue), that's how GPUs work, without vsync, you can see you're rendering 931 frames per second. By not limiting the framerate (through vsync or max_fps), your GPU works to its full capacity. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2532773113/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2533010108","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99269#issuecomment-2533010108","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99269","id":2533010108,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6W-qq8","user":{"login":"AeioMuch","id":75151379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MTUxMzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75151379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch","html_url":"https://github.com/AeioMuch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-10T22:02:04Z","updated_at":"2024-12-13T05:00:00Z","body":"I can reproduce it, on 4.3.stable & 4.4.dev6. But I can't reproduce it on v4.4.dev.custom_build [cf038deb1] compiled with :\n`scons use_mingw=yes use_llvm=yes dev_build=yes` or with `scons use_mingw=yes use_llvm=yes production=yes lto=full`\n\nGodot v4.3.stable - Windows 10.0.19045 - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6636) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-6700K CPU @ 4.00GHz (8 Threads)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2533010108/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2585251009","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99269#issuecomment-2585251009","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99269","id":2585251009,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aF8zB","user":{"login":"RIH-Cellegen","id":67655961,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NjU1OTYx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67655961?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RIH-Cellegen","html_url":"https://github.com/RIH-Cellegen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RIH-Cellegen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RIH-Cellegen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RIH-Cellegen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RIH-Cellegen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RIH-Cellegen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RIH-Cellegen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RIH-Cellegen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RIH-Cellegen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RIH-Cellegen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-11T12:42:48Z","updated_at":"2025-01-11T12:42:48Z","body":"I was also able to reproduce it on 4.3 Stable (With an RX7800 GPU and Ryzen 3 CPU) and I've tested out different things.\nWhat I ended up figuring out is that the Compatibility back-end has this memory leak issue only and that it doesn't matter what or how many Nodes there were in the Node Tree, the memory leak came from the Compatibility back-end.\nForward+ and Mobile back-end didn't reproduce a constant memory increase, so it's fair to assume, that it comes from the Compatibility back-end only.\n\nMore people need to verify this, from different systems and different hardware.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2585251009/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]